OL,3,GNEWSAGarden to be renamed for          
OL,4,ADambusters bomb inventor               
OL,6,FA community orchard is set to be       
OL,7,Frenamed in honour of the inventor of   
OL,8,Fthe bouncing bomb, Sir Barnes Wallis.  
OL,10,FThe common land in Effingham, Surrey - 
OL,11,Fthe village where the World War Two    
OL,12,Fengineer lived - will be officially    
OL,13,Frenamed on Saturday as the Barnes      
OL,14,FWallis Memorial Garden and an          
OL,15,Finformation board about his life will  
OL,16,Fbe unveiled.                           
OL,18,FWallis' invention was used during      
OL,19,FOperation Chastise in 1943, better     
OL,20,Fknown as the Dambusters Raid, to       
OL,21,Fdestroy three dams in Germany.         
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
