OL,3,GNEWSAGarden to be renamed for          
OL,4,ADambusters bomb inventor               
OL,6,FHis daughter Elisabeth Gaunt said her  
OL,7,Ffather "thought Effingham was the best 
OL,8,Fvillage in the world".                 
